# libFuzzer grows `corpus/<target>/` with every interesting input it finds while running - that
# accumulated state doesn't belong in git. The small hand-authored seeds under corpus/abi_json/
# are the exception: they exist to bias the mutator toward the shapes nuthatch#290 names (duplicate
# topic0, absurd tuple depth, a huge fixed-array size), so they're checked in deliberately.
corpus/*
!corpus/abi_json/
corpus/abi_json/*
!corpus/abi_json/*.json
